rompt with the exact tags: <Picture 1> and <Audio 1> (for example: <Picture 1> sings and lip-syncs exactly to <Audio 1>).\n3. The purple node locks the encoded audio latent while the sampler generates video.\n4. Its **original_audio** output goes directly to every final video combine node. H3's decoded/generated audio is intentionally not used.\n5. Keep the Duration value matched to the selected audio clip. Video Combine has **trim_to_audio** enabled as a final safeguard."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "IMPORTANT — Exact Audio / Lip-Sync Path", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#1e1b4b", "size": [734.1609497070312, 187.86849975585938], "pos": [-24.52793312072754, -321.37640380859375], "id": 173, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.7.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"}, "order": 13}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "pixaromaGroups": [], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.47.12", "VHS_latentpreview": true, "ds": {"offset": [-2473.2466858218922, 105.55674097257014], "scale": 0.9646149645000021}}, "groups": [{"color": "#2563eb", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "MODEL LOADERS", "bounding": [-20, -20, 730, 770]}, {"color": "#7c3aed", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "MINIMAX H3 CONDITIONING + LOCKED SOURCE AUDIO", "bounding": [727.5623168945312, -17.517236709594727, 818.8165893554688, 450.6863098144531]}, {"color": "#dc2626", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "SAMPLING — VIDEO DENOISE / AUDIO LOCKED", "bounding": [1556.60888671875, -16.85010528564453, 780, 650]}, {"color": "#059669", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "DECODE + EXACT ORIGINAL AUDIO MUX", "bounding": [2349.57666015625, -14.281506538391113, 694.5181884765625, 646.6496582